# Guardians of the Rift: hopping worlds in the middle of a game ends it for the Pilot. On the new
# world the rift has not opened yet, so the step is to wait for it, not to mine on.
#
# Before the fix, a hop left the last game marked as under way: back in the temple on a world
# still waiting for its rift, the Pilot said to mine fragments.
#
# Facts: as rift-start-to-first-craft.replay (OSRS wiki, Guardians of the Rift); the opening
# message is as the Guardians of the Rift Helper plugin reads it (unconfirmed by the wiki).
include /replays/scenes/rift.scene
skill RUNECRAFT 50
skill MINING 60
items INV RUNE_PICKAXE 1
items INV GOTR_CELL_UNCHARGED 1
at 3606 9492
tick 2
expect step = "Wait for the rift to open"
chat GAMEMESSAGE "The rift becomes active!"
tick
expect step = "Mine guardian fragments"
expect stat.Rift_open ~ ":"

state HOPPING
state LOGGED_IN
tick
expect activity = RIFT
expect step = "Wait for the rift to open"
expect stat.Rift_open = "-"
